---Specifies transition drawing priority. This represents the positive offset from this tile's `layer_group`. Internally, the final layer is computed as `layer_group + layer` (a [uint16](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/uint16.html)), wrapping back to `"zero"` after the `"top"` layer.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/TilePrototype.html%23layer#layer)
