---@
---
---The base group of render layers this tile belongs to. It can be moved up inside this group using the `layer` property. See the [TileRenderLayer](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/TileRenderLayer.html) page to see the sizes of all layer groups.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/TilePrototype.html%23layer_group#layer_group)
